  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Honor and Respect Thin Blue Line Concealed-Ops Hoodie featurs Thin Blue Line flag graphics on the front and back, this hoodie combines style, functionality, and comfort. The large pass-through kangaroo pocket provides easy access to a waistband holster or appendix carry. Zippered pockets on both sleeves offer additional storage, with a loop patch on the right sleeve and 2 pen pockets on the left.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "132970",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Honor and Respect Thin Blue Line Concealed-Ops Hoodie featurs Thin Blue Line flag graphics on the front and back, this hoodie combines style, functionality, and comfort. The large pass-through kangaroo pocket provides easy access to a waistband holster or appendix carry. Zippered pockets on both sleeves offer additional storage, with a loop patch on the right sleeve and 2 pen pockets on the left. The zippered left sleeve pocket includes a wire pass-through port for headphones. Thumb holes in the cuffs add extra coverage and prevent the sleeves from riding up. Made from a comfortable, moisture-wicking performance material, this hoodie is perfect for daily wear. Proceeds from this purchase benefit families of fallen first responders, allowing you to show your support while making a difference.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
